     1153   PROCEDURE adm-update-record :
     1154       MESSAGE
     1155         "Object ":U THIS-PROCEDURE:FILE-NAME
     1156           "must have at least one Enabled Table to perform Update.":U
     1157             VIEW-AS ALERT-BOX ERROR.
